WEBVTT

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:05.010
You know...

00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:05.850
Hm?

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:09.870
It's great that Princess 
got her memories back.

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:11.620
Yeah.

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:16.180
I wouldn't be able to handle 
it if we disappeared

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:17.490
from her memories.

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:20.680
True.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:24.160
Before I realized it, 
she'd become irreplaceable.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:25.240
What?

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:27.880
I-I mean to the family.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:33.170
I feel a bit ashamed.

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:35.730
Princess used her Arcana powers

00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:38.440
to help Papa, even though 
she knew the risk,

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:40.350
and wasn't afraid.

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:46.210
And compared to that, what am I doing?

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:48.170
It's not just you.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:51.610
I feel the same.

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:41.550
I would like you to share 
your strong desires with me.

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:44.300
To establish Gli Amanti, The Lovers,

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:47.170
you must have someone else.

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:51.520
Love cannot be completed 
with you alone.

00:02:53.390 --> 00:02:54.960
You lack heart.

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:58.770
<i>Love... Heart...</i>

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:01.050
Milady.

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:03.950
I brought you camomilla tea, today.

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:06.570
It should help you feel better.

00:03:07.030 --> 00:03:08.430
Hey, Luca.

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:09.110
Yes?

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:12.460
What exactly is love?

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:17.130
Love

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:17.130
<i>M-Milady is in love?!</i>

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:21.610
<i>Milady is in love? It can't be true!</i>

00:03:21.610 --> 00:03:22.590
<i>With whom?!</i>

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:26.070
<i>No, no, it is much too early.</i>

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:26.900
<i>Who is it?</i>

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:30.010
<i>I will not forgive the one 
deceiving you, Milady!</i>

00:03:30.010 --> 00:03:31.970
<i>I fear I may have 
asked the wrong person.</i>

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:33.020
<i>I will not forgive them...</i>

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:35.710
Milady, it is I.

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:41.700
It all looks so delicious.

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:43.860
I can't wait to eat!

00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:46.830
You've got to wait until Milady comes.

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:48.080
Okay.

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:50.800
Whoa! This all looks great!

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:51.980
That's a lot of food...

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:53.830
Oh, you mustn't!

00:03:54.260 --> 00:03:56.930
This is for Milady's 
recovery celebration.

00:03:56.930 --> 00:03:58.170
Recovery celebration?

00:03:58.510 --> 00:04:01.030
Yeah. I had these three help me

00:04:01.030 --> 00:04:02.650
and spent all morning baking it.

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:04.990
We're going to have her eat lots!

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.100
We should do something, too!

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:13.310
I thank you for coming.

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:17.730
I didn't want anyone else to hear.

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:21.040
It's about Mondo.

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:24.030
The relationship between 
Papa and The World

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:25.600
hasn't changed, right?

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:29.160
If you already know, 
then this shouldn't take long.

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:34.990
As things stand, 
Mondo will fall into a coma again.

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:39.880
I heard the voice of Gli Amanti.

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:44.980
It said it would negate The Wheel 
of Fortune's consequences.

00:04:44.980 --> 00:04:45.950
What?

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:49.810
But it said I lacked the heart for that,

00:04:50.360 --> 00:04:52.930
because I can't complete love on my own.

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:57.830
What should I do?

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:01.250
Why are you laughing?!

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:04.860
Pardons, Milady.

00:05:05.230 --> 00:05:09.490
I just thought it'd be a rather 
amusing research subject.

00:05:11.460 --> 00:05:13.500
Well, for example,

00:05:14.270 --> 00:05:17.200
why don't you choose 
either Libertá or Nova

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:19.710
to be your lover in this?

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:20.750
What?

00:05:21.570 --> 00:05:24.140
The only reason you're sitting here now

00:05:24.140 --> 00:05:26.280
is because of the two of them.

00:05:32.940 --> 00:05:36.890
I don't really care what 
decision you reach,

00:05:37.430 --> 00:05:41.250
but you're the only one 
who can save Mondo.

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:48.740
Oh, hey, Princess!

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:53.230
Are you busy tomorrow?

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:56.410
Let's hit the sea to 
celebrate your recovery!

00:05:58.700 --> 00:05:59.780
Sure.

00:06:12.990 --> 00:06:14.290
Well then,

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:16.140
let's celebrate Princess' recovery!

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:17.950
Salute!

00:06:21.210 --> 00:06:22.950
It's delicious!

00:06:22.950 --> 00:06:25.230
The sea breeze feels so nice.

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:28.300
Thanks for bringing me.

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:32.120
Actually...

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:34.520
There's one more present.

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:39.180
It's so cute!

00:06:39.180 --> 00:06:41.070
We got it from Ms. Federica's shop.

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:43.500
It's from the both of us.

00:06:44.810 --> 00:06:46.030
Thank you.

00:06:49.210 --> 00:06:50.390
Looks good.

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:51.220
Yeah.

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:55.010
Thank you, for everything.

00:06:56.680 --> 00:07:00.980
It's because of the both of 
you that I'm able to be here.

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:04.480
The two of you saved me.

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:06.510
Thank you.

00:07:06.510 --> 00:07:09.850
Well, when you say it like that...

00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:12.320
We only did what we had to.

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:16.040
But I wanted to actually say it.

00:07:31.100 --> 00:07:33.140
And Princess is totally asleep.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:35.310
She must have been exhausted.

00:07:35.310 --> 00:07:36.640
Let's let her be.

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:37.470
Yeah.

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:41.110
If it weren't for Princess,

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:44.730
we'd never be standing 
here fishing together.

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:47.940
It's true that the atmosphere

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:49.770
of the family has changed 
because of Fel.

00:07:51.230 --> 00:07:54.870
I've always only had time 
to worry about myself,

00:07:56.570 --> 00:07:58.080
but I want to change.

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:03.800
But I'm still scared to 
use my Arcana powers.

00:08:07.530 --> 00:08:10.260
I'll tell you about my past, as well.

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:22.230
So the man that saved 
you at Casa Bianca

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:27.230
and the masked man on the boat

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:28.650
was Dante?

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:35.450
I think he was fighting us to 
make me use my Arcana powers.

00:08:37.170 --> 00:08:38.490
I see.

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:42.490
I'm no match for Dante.

00:08:43.030 --> 00:08:44.760
He's so big and massive,

00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:48.050
and I'm always chasing his back.

00:08:49.020 --> 00:08:53.230
I envy you for having someone 
you aspire to be like.

00:08:53.890 --> 00:08:55.090
I want to surpass him.

00:08:55.690 --> 00:08:58.820
Otherwise, I won't be able 
to protect Felicitá.

00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:04.980
Knowing you, you'll probably 
be able to surpass him.

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:06.190
What?

00:09:07.180 --> 00:09:08.750
What are you going to do

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:10.730
if you can't believe in yourself?

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:13.690
Nova...

00:09:24.530 --> 00:09:25.620
You're awake.

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:29.020
I totally...

00:09:29.020 --> 00:09:30.410
You must have been tired.

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:32.290
Sorry for dragging you out here.

00:09:32.290 --> 00:09:33.090
It's okay.

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:35.690
I'll give you a hand.

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:37.050
Thanks.

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:47.430
Princess!

00:09:47.430 --> 00:09:48.270
Fel!

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:10.250
There's an island over there!

00:10:20.790 --> 00:10:23.420
She'll be fine. She's breathing.

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:27.650
I just hope she wakes up soon.

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:35.260
So she was trying to grab this?

00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:42.870
Her hand is cold.

00:10:45.420 --> 00:10:47.240
You're right. We have to 
hurry and warm her up!

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:53.710
There's driftwood. If we use this...

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:57.240
But we don't have anything 
to start a fire.

00:10:58.380 --> 00:10:59.580
I'll start the fire.

00:11:01.350 --> 00:11:03.390
I can start the fire with 
my powers of The Fool.

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:05.810
Libertá...

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:10.550
Both you and Princess believe in me.

00:11:11.430 --> 00:11:12.210
So...

00:11:13.100 --> 00:11:15.360
What am I going to do if I 
don't believe in myself?

00:11:22.170 --> 00:11:23.280
Burn!

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:28.830
Pensiero Realizzare!

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:33.380
Have you found your answer?

00:11:34.110 --> 00:11:35.340
My answer?

00:11:36.680 --> 00:11:38.950
If you chose one to get close to,

00:11:38.950 --> 00:11:42.550
it'd be easy to determine 
feelings and relationships.

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:46.400
But I don't think that's what love is.

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:49.000
Papa is important to me,

00:11:49.550 --> 00:11:52.520
but I want to decide with my heart,

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:55.020
not choose because I have to.

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:59.800
My host, we do not have time.

00:12:02.680 --> 00:12:04.890
They have found their answer,

00:12:05.830 --> 00:12:08.220
even while you hesitate.

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:12.460
You're awake.

00:12:13.340 --> 00:12:14.330
I...

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:19.840
Libertá used his Arcana powers,

00:12:20.660 --> 00:12:22.040
for you.

00:12:22.040 --> 00:12:23.000
What?

00:12:29.170 --> 00:12:30.250
You...

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:33.230
No,

00:12:34.510 --> 00:12:35.680
never mind.

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:51.950
You fools!

00:12:53.100 --> 00:12:55.570
You do this every time.

00:12:56.110 --> 00:12:59.190
Not only did you leave with 
Milady, who's still recovering,

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:01.550
but how dare you put her 
in harm's way, as well?!

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:03.610
Yeah, but...

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:06.860
I invited the both of 
them in celebration

00:13:06.860 --> 00:13:08.350
of Felicitá's recovery.

00:13:08.990 --> 00:13:09.790
I apologize.

00:13:10.710 --> 00:13:12.630
We were able to save Felicitá

00:13:12.630 --> 00:13:15.560
because Libertá used 
his Arcana powers.

00:13:16.910 --> 00:13:19.240
I wasn't able to save Fel.

00:13:26.380 --> 00:13:28.410
Nova's matured.

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:29.250
What?

00:13:30.420 --> 00:13:35.480
The one you have to surpass may be him.

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:40.630
Hey, wait a sec, Nova!

00:13:41.490 --> 00:13:42.600
What is it?

00:13:42.600 --> 00:13:45.240
Why did you say something 
to defend me back there?

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:47.980
Because I was able to make 
up my mind because of you.

00:13:47.980 --> 00:13:48.590
What?

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:52.850
I'm going to try to awaken my parents.

00:13:56.710 --> 00:13:58.610
I wasn't able to forgive my parents

00:13:58.610 --> 00:14:01.830
for using me as a tool of succession

00:14:01.830 --> 00:14:04.780
and plotting to kill Papa and Mama.

00:14:06.300 --> 00:14:07.280
And...

00:14:13.590 --> 00:14:17.380
because of that rage, 
my powers of Death went out of control,

00:14:17.900 --> 00:14:20.980
and my parents wouldn't wake up.

00:14:23.370 --> 00:14:26.850
So you didn't purposely put 
your parents to sleep?

00:14:27.350 --> 00:14:28.760
No, it's the same.

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:33.720
That was the only way I 
could stop my parents.

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:35.090
And...

00:14:35.820 --> 00:14:39.330
I don't regret putting them to sleep.

00:14:40.870 --> 00:14:42.880
Why are you lying?

00:14:45.670 --> 00:14:47.100
Be more honest with yourself!

00:14:47.100 --> 00:14:48.320
You do regret it, don't you?

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:50.790
Leave me alone.

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:53.520
What do you mean, leave you alone?!

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:55.120
You're suffering, too!

00:14:56.490 --> 00:14:58.190
This has nothing to do with you!

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:01.260
How can you say this has 
nothing to do with me?!

00:15:04.350 --> 00:15:06.570
This is exactly what I hate about you!

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:08.370
You try to be so mature and act like

00:15:08.370 --> 00:15:10.360
you're the only one that 
knows what's going on.

00:15:10.860 --> 00:15:12.550
That's what I get for letting you talk...

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:16.260
We're a family.

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:21.690
Let me help, too.

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:24.390
Libertá...

00:15:26.660 --> 00:15:29.450
Let me help you as well, Nova.

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:35.870
Thanks.

00:15:46.440 --> 00:15:47.590
It's no use.

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:49.820
This is so hard that I have 
no idea what I'm reading.

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:53.560
I can't seem to find the 
information I'm looking for.

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:58.300
There aren't many that 
have Arcana powers,

00:15:58.840 --> 00:16:00.980
so the resources are limited.

00:16:05.010 --> 00:16:07.470
I'm getting sleepy...

00:16:09.380 --> 00:16:12.120
Hey, when we were fighting on the boat,

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:14.010
you put everyone to sleep.

00:16:14.010 --> 00:16:16.500
But all of them got away later, right?

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:18.120
Yeah. What of it?

00:16:18.430 --> 00:16:21.830
Meaning they weren't 
stuck sleeping forever.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:23.500
I wonder why.

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:31.420
And the simpleton brings 
up a very valid point.

00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:35.390
Since I am researching Nova's parents,

00:16:36.070 --> 00:16:39.080
I believe that I can 
answer that for you.

00:16:40.170 --> 00:16:43.060
What the hell. 
If you know, just tell us already.

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:48.070
This is just one part of my research.

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:52.850
If you tell me the results 
of the experiment,

00:16:52.850 --> 00:16:55.520
I don't mind telling you.

00:16:57.210 --> 00:17:02.710
If there really is a way 
to awaken my parents,

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:05.960
please tell me.

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:12.530
Are you really going to do it?

00:17:12.530 --> 00:17:13.480
Yeah.

00:17:13.480 --> 00:17:14.490
But...

00:17:15.830 --> 00:17:17.680
This is my recompense,

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:21.110
for what I've done to my 
parents all these years.

00:17:23.760 --> 00:17:25.940
There's no way that you 
wouldn't be able to

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:28.190
break the effects of 
your own Arcana powers.

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:33.440
If they are asleep because you 
lost control of your powers,

00:17:34.540 --> 00:17:38.780
then you'll have to wish even 
harder for them to wake up.

00:17:41.430 --> 00:17:44.370
Just use your Arcana powers 
with even more desire

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:48.320
than you did when you 
put them to sleep.

00:17:52.230 --> 00:17:59.730
But, as a consequence, 
you may not be able to wake up.

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:01.630
I don't care,

00:18:01.630 --> 00:18:03.620
as long as they wake up.

00:18:06.050 --> 00:18:08.980
<i>I always envied Fel, whose parents</i>

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:10.300
<i>loved her unconditionally.</i>

00:18:10.970 --> 00:18:12.570
<i>But that's not exactly right.</i>

00:18:13.790 --> 00:18:17.840
<i>Fel has always genuinely 
loved her family.</i>

00:18:17.840 --> 00:18:19.530
<i>That's what I envied.</i>

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:24.180
Mother, Father, I can...

00:18:25.770 --> 00:18:28.620
La Tenebrore Addormentato!

00:18:37.710 --> 00:18:38.780
Nova!

00:18:38.780 --> 00:18:39.790
Stay back!

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:46.810
It'll be fine.

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:50.870
I'll awaken them... no matter what.

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:19.470
Nova?

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:22.740
Thank goodness.

00:19:22.740 --> 00:19:23.550
Are you all right?

00:19:25.460 --> 00:19:28.400
Yeah. Did I lose consciousness?

00:19:28.400 --> 00:19:29.310
Yes.

00:19:29.990 --> 00:19:31.830
What about my mother and father?

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:39.030
I see...

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:43.030
W-Well, even Jolly said 
it would take some time.

00:19:43.610 --> 00:19:45.070
Let's wait until morning.

00:19:45.070 --> 00:19:45.770
'Kay?

00:19:47.760 --> 00:19:50.560
You're hogging the blanket, Libertá.

00:19:50.560 --> 00:19:52.950
Well, we're close to the 
window and it's cold.

00:19:52.950 --> 00:19:54.860
That doesn't mean you 
should hog it all!

00:19:55.770 --> 00:19:57.250
You two really do get along.

00:19:57.250 --> 00:19:58.130
Why would you think that?!

00:19:58.130 --> 00:19:59.340
What he said.

00:20:01.370 --> 00:20:03.680
But I am grateful.

00:20:05.290 --> 00:20:06.770
It's because you two were here

00:20:06.770 --> 00:20:07.910
that I could make my decision.

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:10.770
Then I'd like to thank you guys, too.

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:13.710
The reason I was able to come 
to terms with my Arcana powers

00:20:13.710 --> 00:20:14.900
is because of you two.

00:20:20.190 --> 00:20:21.610
I...

00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:25.290
If you chose one to get close to,

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:28.640
it'd be easy to determine 
feelings and relationships.

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:33.510
I wonder what love is...

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:37.420
It's complicated, isn't it?

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:41.540
And then you fall asleep?!

00:20:42.140 --> 00:20:44.510
Well, that's no surprise.

00:20:47.950 --> 00:20:50.100
I'm going to fight for Fel.

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:51.660
So am I.

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:54.100
I'm going to be the one 
who frees Princess.

00:20:55.340 --> 00:20:57.560
I'm not going to hold 
back at the Duello.

00:20:58.470 --> 00:20:59.780
I wouldn't want you to.

00:21:00.390 --> 00:21:05.420
Nova's parents have not 
completely recovered,

00:21:05.420 --> 00:21:07.860
but should be on the road to recovery.

00:21:07.860 --> 00:21:08.870
I see.

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:11.110
It appears there was some regret

00:21:11.110 --> 00:21:14.390
towards the attempt to 
kill you and Sumire

00:21:14.390 --> 00:21:17.170
and the poor treatment towards Nova.

00:21:17.450 --> 00:21:21.310
Nova's strong feelings 
may have reached them.

00:21:24.640 --> 00:21:28.980
Tomorrow is finally the Arcana Duello.

00:23:33.550 --> 00:23:34.750
What? The last episode?!

00:23:34.750 --> 00:23:35.510
Seriously?!

00:23:35.510 --> 00:23:36.300
I wasn't informed of this!

00:23:36.300 --> 00:23:36.960
Huh?!

00:23:36.960 --> 00:23:37.910
What are we talking about?

00:23:37.910 --> 00:23:38.860
Milady!

00:23:38.860 --> 00:23:40.160
Just kidding!

00:23:40.160 --> 00:23:41.500
Have you lost your mind?
